    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate a space and transform it into a functional pawn shop! Save money for the renovation, or don't renovate at all! Gain skills that you can use later to make smart buying and selling decisions, boosting your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/9a4473d5582df3b3b4e5def756d2ad2f.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform |</strong>\u00a0Renovate your pawn shop by building your workspace from scratch. Paint the walls, floors and create the space for a successful business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/5e4ec7464edf72036f4f48cc448a93a8.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotation |</strong> After assessing the item's value, propose a price for the product. SScan the product, set a fair value, and negotiate without going below 45% of the average price.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/5c6c4dcc552c4955800ac4bdc73c174f.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize\u00a0|</strong> Set up your pawn shop by creating spots for shelves to display your goods. Customize the layout to fit your trading needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/c141e9d5398012b729fd46036898baa7.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Renovate a space and transform it into a functional pawn shop! Save money for the renovation, or don't renovate at all! Gain skills that you can use later to make smart buying and selling decisions, boosting your profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/9a4473d5582df3b3b4e5def756d2ad2f.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Transform |</strong>\u00a0Renovate your pawn shop by building your workspace from scratch. Paint the walls, floors and create the space for a successful business.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/5e4ec7464edf72036f4f48cc448a93a8.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Negotation |</strong> After assessing the item's value, propose a price for the product. SScan the product, set a fair value, and negotiate without going below 45% of the average price.  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/5c6c4dcc552c4955800ac4bdc73c174f.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Organize\u00a0|</strong> Set up your pawn shop by creating spots for shelves to display your goods. Customize the layout to fit your trading needs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3149100/extras/c141e9d5398012b729fd46036898baa7.avif?t=1742085418\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
